    "text": "fox47.com\nwebsite\nSauk County, Wisconsin\nMissing Sauk Co. man found safe in Washington state\nBy Maria Brunetta,\n1 days agoARLINGTON, WASH. -- The man missing from his Baraboo home for over a week has been found safe in Washington state, according to the Sauk County Sheriff's Office. John Breneman was officially declared missing on Aug. 20 when his Life Alert button was pressed. Authorities believed that he was in Arlington, Wash. on Aug. 17.\n2",
